          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. The 6 Best, Ranked</a>
          <a href="#gate-width" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Gate and Storage Width</a>
          <a href="#deck" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Stamped vs Fabricated</a>
          <a href="#transaxles" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Engines and Transaxles</a>
          <a href="#electric" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Electric at 42 Inches</a>
